<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Short Message</title>
    <style>
        /* Basic Styling to center the text */
        body {
            font-family: sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4; /* Light gray background */
            text-align: center;
        }
        .message {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 80%;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="message">
        Anh yêu em nhiềuuuu
        This is the short text I wanted to display online. It should be centered and easy to read.
    </div>
</body>
</html>
